# ModelGen (Laptop Frontier v22)

**Local-First, Content-Addressed, Verifier-Gated Skill Library & Program Synthesis Engine.**

ModelGen is an on-device code synthesis engine running entirely on a standard laptop (no datacenters, no cloud APIs). It organizes, mutation-tests, decontaminates, and synthesizes Python algorithms with sub-millisecond query latency.

---

## Key Capabilities

- **Sub-Millisecond Query Latency**: **0.06ms** P99 query latency via SQLite WAL and 64-bit signed SimHash LSH index.
- **Learned Neural Router**: Lightweight **160K parameter (<1MB)** InfoNCE contrastive neural embedding model.
- **100% Held-Out Recall**: Solves **50/50 held-out benchmark problems** across 5 categories (Algorithms, Strings, Data Structures, Math, Utilities).
- **Multi-Module Program Synthesis**:
  - Linear $A \to B$ Type-Bridge Composition (`compose.py`)
  - Multi-Branch Join Non-Linear DAG Synthesis (`dag_composer.py`)
- **Quality & Security Gates**:
  - **Mutation Testing Quality Gate**: AST mutation testing achieving **80.7% active mutant kill-rate**.
  - **Split-Policy Decontamination Filter**: Zero benchmark test assertion leakage.
  - **Decentralized P2P Federation**: Beta-Bernoulli peer trust estimation with automated quarantine for malicious nodes.
  - **AST Redundancy Pruning & MDL Compression**: Automated dead code elimination and zero-forgetting regression verification.
- **LMStudio-Style Dark-Themed GUI**: Real-time browser studio with live sandbox execution badges.

---

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/akshaybhlrp/ModelGen.git
cd ModelGen
pip install -e .
```

---

## Quickstart

### 1. Launch Studio GUI (LMStudio-Style Web Interface)
```bash
modelgen-gui
```
Open **[http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080)** in your browser.

### 2. Natural Language Query (CLI)
```bash
modelgen query "binary search integer in list" -v
modelgen query "check if string is palindrome" -v
```

### 3. Multi-Module Composition Pipeline
```bash
modelgen compose --in-type str --out-type int --test-code "def test(): assert pipeline('HELLO WORLD') == 3"
```

### 4. Run Benchmark Suite & Self-Learning Loop
```bash
python3 eval.py
python3 self_learning_progress.py
```

### 5. Run Full Test Battery
```bash
pytest test_battery.py -v
```

---

## Project Structure

```
ModelGen/
├── kernel.py                  # Core SQLite WAL storage, SimHash LSH, and subprocess sandbox
├── learned_router.py          # InfoNCE contrastive neural router (<1MB weights)
├── compose.py                 # Linear A -> B type-bridge composition engine
├── dag_composer.py            # Non-linear multi-branch DAG program synthesis
├── tuner.py                   # Bounded template parameter search engine
├── mutation_tester.py         # AST mutation testing & weak-test quarantine gate
├── decontaminate.py           # Split-policy benchmark leak prevention filter
├── compress_mdl.py            # Phase 2 MDL compression and minification
├── federation.py              # Phase 4 P2P federation and Beta-Bernoulli peer trust
├── pruner.py                  # AST semantic deduplication & forgetting gate
├── eval.py                    # 50-problem held-out benchmark evaluation harness
├── self_learning_progress.py  # 5-step autonomous self-learning progress loop
├── cli.py                     # Command-line interface tool
├── app_gui.py                 # Studio GUI backend server
├── web/index.html             # Studio dark-mode frontend GUI
├── test_battery.py            # Complete 16-test unit & integration battery
└── benchmarks_50.json         # 50 canonical held-out benchmark problems
```

